Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "SkateboardOnRoadAnomaly" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasEvidence :evidence1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Skateboard lying on road" .

:evidence1 a :FallingObjectIndicator ;
    :description "Skateboard appears to have fallen from a vehicle" ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1, :risk2 .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential collision with skateboard on road" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Skateboard obstructing lane, causing potential lane intrusion risk" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.65"^^xsd:float .

:weather1 a :DayCondition, :ClearCondition .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

Risk 1:
Description: Potential collision with skateboard on road
Severity Score: 0.75

Risk 2:
Description: Skateboard obstructing lane, causing potential lane intrusion risk
Severity Score: 0.65